Cell[TextData[{
 "For this last section we will simply wrote the analytical evolution \
equations for our system in the large ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["N", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a0c33148-6e7c-4cd6-b2e3-a2ff5de42a1c"],
 " limit for the Uniform model. An proper explanation and derivation of the \
results can be found in the aforementioned paper: \
https://arxiv.org/pdf/2108.04885.pdf "
}], "Text",
